What it is:
  A copy of the PrismML fork of llama.cpp (base revision prism-b10743-adfffbe, 2026-09-25) with
  additional single-GPU (NVIDIA Tesla V100, compute capability 7.0) decode tuning, plus an MTP
  speculative-decoding recipe and the tooling used to validate it. See bonsai-v100/.

